### Home
GET http://localhost:1198/

### Register User
POST http://localhost:1198/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ashish",
  "email": "ashish@example.com",
  "password": "replace-with-a-strong-example-password"
}

### Login User
POST http://localhost:1198/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ashish@example.com",
  "password": "replace-with-a-strong-example-password"
}

### Get Logged In User
GET http://localhost:1198/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Logout User
POST http://localhost:1198/api/auth/logout
